      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيَّاسٌ</span></b>  <i>A possessor of </i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُيُوس</span> [or <i>he-goats</i>]: (M:)
or <i>one who holds the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيْس</span>. (S, K: explained in
the former by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الَّذِى يُمْسِكُ التَّيْسَ</span>: and in like
